+
+| Channel | Command | Platforms |
+|---|---|---|
+| Homebrew tap | `brew tap <org>/hive https://github.com/<org>/homebrew-hive && brew install <org>/hive/hive` | macOS arm64 (tier-1), x86_64 (tier-2) |
+| AUR | `yay -S hive-bin` | Arch Linux (tier-1) |
+| One-liner | `curl -fsSL https://github.com/ivankuznetsov/hive/releases/latest/download/install.sh \| bash` | All tier-1: macOS, Ubuntu 22.04+, Debian 12+, Fedora 40+; WSL2 (tier-2) |
